<title>BELGIUM: EU says Hoechst's Clariant stake outside EU rules.</title>
<headline>EU says Hoechst's Clariant stake outside EU rules.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Thursday that the acquisition by Hoechst AG of a 45-percent stake in Clariant AG fell outside the merger regulation.</p>
<p>It said in a statement clearing Clariant's buy of Hoechst's specialty chemicals business Virteon GmbH, that the stake would not give Hoechst control of the Swiss chemicals firm.</p>
<p>A Commission spokesman explained later that although the stake was big it only gave Hoechst 10 percent of the voting rights in Clariant.</p>
</text>
